{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53499","headline":"同观察使张公仲方大和元年夏祷雨归至圣泉寺作（题拟） · 李敬彝","name":"同观察使张公仲方大和元年夏祷雨归至圣泉寺作（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨随青嶂合，云拂画旗来。\n（见《淳熙三山志》卷八、《闽都记》卷十一）（〖1〗《淳熙三山志》云：「今诗牌在圣泉。\n」同作者爲张仲方、李贻孙、彭城三人，《全唐诗》仅收仲方诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李敬彝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}